---
interface Props{kind:'article'|'post_comment';target:string}
const{kind,target}=Astro.props;
---
<section id="comments" class="discussion-section" data-discussion-kind={kind} data-discussion-target={target}><div class="section-heading"><h2>读到这里，聊两句</h2><label>评论排序<select data-comment-sort><option value="hot">最热</option><option value="newest">最新</option><option value="oldest">最早</option></select></label></div><p data-guest-only><a href={`/auth/?next=${encodeURIComponent(Astro.url.pathname+'#comments')}`}>登录后参与讨论 →</a></p><form class="form-stack" data-comment-form data-auth-only hidden><label>留下你的感想<textarea name="content" maxlength="2000" required placeholder="哪一句让你停了停？写写你的想法。"></textarea></label><p data-reply-hint hidden></p><div><button>发表讨论</button><button type="button" data-cancel-reply hidden>取消回复</button></div></form><div data-comments-list aria-live="polite"><p class="muted">正在加载评论…</p></div><button data-more-comments hidden>查看更多讨论</button></section><script>import '../scripts/discussions';</script>
